  "notes": "Composed of {頭痛|ずつう} (headache) + {薬|やく} (medicine). Available over the counter at {薬局|やっきょく} (pharmacies) and ドラッグストア (drugstores) in Japan.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {頭痛薬|ずつうやく}を{飲|の}む: to take headache medicine\n- {頭痛薬|ずつうやく}を{買|か}う: to buy headache medicine\n- {頭痛薬|ずつうやく}が{効|き}く: the headache medicine works\n\nCOMMON BRANDS IN JAPAN:\n- バファリン (Bufferin)\n- イブ (Eve)\n- ロキソニン (Loxonin)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {頭痛|ずつう}: headache\n- {鎮痛剤|ちんつうざい}: painkiller (broader — any pain)\n- {市販薬|しはんやく}: over-the-counter medicine\n- {処方薬|しょほうやく}: prescription medicine",
